.\" ###### Setup ############################################################
.Dd October 23, 2026
.Dt pdfembedfonts 1
.Os pdfembedfonts
.\" ###### Name #############################################################
.Sh NAME
.Nm pdfembedfonts
.Nd PDF Fonts Embedder
.\" ###### Synopsis #########################################################
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm pdfembedfonts
.Ar input_pdf output_pdf
.br
.Op Fl O | Fl \-optimise | Fl \-optimize
.Nm pdfembedfonts
.Op Fl h | Fl \-help
.Nm pdfembedfonts
.Op Fl v | Fl \-version
.\" ###### Description ######################################################
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm pdfembedfonts
uses Ghostscript to make a copy of a given PDF file, embedding all
required font data. Optionally, the resulting PDF can also be optimised
("fast web view", "linearised").
.Pp
.\" ###### Arguments ########################################################
.Sh ARGUMENTS
The following arguments and options may be provided:
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Ar input_pdf
The input PDF file name.
.It Ar output_pdf
The output PDF file name.
.It Fl O | Fl \-optimise | Fl \-optimize
Optimize the resulting PDF file for fast web view.
.It Fl h | Fl \-help
Prints command\-line help.
.It Fl v | Fl \-version
Prints program version.
.El
.\" ###### Exit status ######################################################
.Sh EXIT STATUS
The
.Nm
tool exits with 0 on success, and >0 in case of an error.
.\" ###### Examples #########################################################
.Sh EXAMPLES
Embed all fonts into a PDF file:
.Bd -literal
pdfembedfonts MyDocument.pdf MyDocument\-with\-Embedded\-Fonts.pdf
.Ed
.Pp
Embed all fonts and optimize for fast web view:
.Bd -literal
pdfembedfonts MyDocument.pdf MyDocument\-with\-Embedded\-Fonts\-and\-Optimised.pdf \-O
.Ed
.Pp
Print command\-line help:
.Bd -literal
pdfembedfonts \-\-help
.Ed
.Pp
Print program version:
.Bd -literal
pdfembedfonts \-\-version
.Ed
